      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Trapped-ion quantum-information proposals and experiments turned entanglement control into a precise, scalable physical platform.",
        "attribution": "Cirac and Zoller provided seminal architectures and protocols, with Blatt furnishing defining experimental realizations.",
        "maturity": "The work has endured for decades, been independently reproduced, and supports both computation and precision science.",
