        "nobel_worthiness": "Squeezed states converted a nonclassical quantum-optics resource into demonstrably improved measurement sensitivity.",
        "attribution": "Caves articulated the quantum limit and squeezing advantage; Kimble and Mavalvala represent essential experimental development and precision-measurement use.",
        "maturity": "Squeezing is a robust laboratory tool with conspicuous application in gravitational-wave observatories.",
